<title>POLAND: Poland to offer PLN 1 bln of fixed bonds on Aug 6.</title>
<headline>Poland to offer PLN 1 bln of fixed bonds on Aug 6.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish finance ministry will offer one billion zlotys ($288.4 million) worth of 15-percent two-year bonds and 12-percent five-year bonds at a tender for institutional investors on August 6, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Payment for the bonds, maturing October 12, 1999 and 2002, is on August 12, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700 ($ = 3.468 Polish Zlotys)</p>
